  "notes": "The anthemic, funk-sample end of the TDE bench — DJ Khalil-mentored, and the difference from his mentor is brightness rather than layer count. The research names the g-funk hybrid explicitly: \"major-mode funk/soul sources over minor-inflected bass\", so the scale set puts `mixolydian` and `major` level with `dorian` and the bass sits in minor underneath. \"4-bar loops with functional motion rather than vamps\" gives a `ii–v–i` family alongside `i–iv–VII–III` and `borrowed.V` at 0.25 — this is not a static-bed model. His DAW is **Ableton** and the sourced method is \"drums and keyboards\" with \"live-feel swing … hats played rather than gridded\": `swing.amount` 0.57, `quantizeStrength` 0.66, 10ms of jitter on the closed hats, ghost 16ths at 0.42 across four positions, and hand percussion across five lanes. \"His signature is a bright, up-tempo soul/funk loop with horn or guitar stabs\" is `timbreHint` `horn_stab` with `articulation` `staccato` and an arch-weighted contour, and \"countermelody supplied by a second sampled figure\" is `densityRatio` 0.50 across three styles. The bass is played or sampled and walks under the changes: `independent_riff` at `followRootsProb` 0.50 with major-mode cell shapes, `bass808.role` demoted to `counter_riff` as \"a soft sub reinforcement rather than a lead\". ⚠ `medium`, and the research says why: \"instrumentation, DAW and mentorship documented; drum specifics partly inferred **[LOW-CONF]**\". The INFERRED parameters are every drum placement number and the specific progression families — the research names \"functional motion\" but no romans. ⚠ `switchUpProb` 0.22 exists because the research names \"a bridge that changes the sample's filter or key\" as a structural habit. ⚠ **`lockTo808` raised from 0.4 to 0.61.** The 808 takes each kick with this probability, and at 0.4 over this model's 8-kick floor a seed could produce no 808 at all — which `bass808.rs` refuses, because a declared 808 that sometimes vanishes is a part a producer cannot rely on. It is still well under a lock: a good share of kicks carry no sub. ⚠ The bass ceiling came down from 48 to 47 so it stays under a chord part that starts at 48 — `coherence.rs` requires the highest bass note to sit at or below the lowest chord note, and this model overlapped by 1.",
